# Git language

Branch names and commit messages are in English.

- Use Conventional Commits. The subject says why the change exists.
- Do not mention Cursor, agents, or other assistants in the subject, body, or trailers.

```text
# Bad
git checkout -b ejercicio
git commit -m "docs: documenta el enunciado"

# Good
git checkout -b exercise
git commit -m "docs: add the exercise brief"
```
